'''Enter The Ninja''' (ザ・ニンジャ, ''Za Ninja'', '''The Ninja''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (M): Cats' movement speed increases by 15%.

